{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26297","headline":"劝政楼下观百官献寿 · 沈亚之","name":"劝政楼下观百官献寿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御气黄花节，临轩紫陌头。\n早阳生彩杖，霁色入仙楼。\n献寿皆鸳鹭，瞻天在冕旒。\n菊尊开九日，凤历啓千秋。\n乐阕祥烟起，杯酣瑞影收。\n年年歌舞夕，此地庆皇休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}